			"id":"ac9edbcfc2d31c9d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# # Blue Book - Solution\n- Get a Watering Can\n- Refill with water from the still in Trading Post\n- Store in the Coat Check\n- Use [[Blessing of the Monk.canvas|Blessing of the Monk]] to draft a [[Secret Passage.canvas|Secret Passage]] in the Outer Room\n- Get the Watering Can and use it to tint the Blank Book into the blue color.",
